{
  "case_id": "A-010",
  "category": "composite_reassignment",
  "description": [
    "Initialization: Assign tasks (descending reward) to satellite with highest composite score ",
    "(window records, window count, load, overlap ratio, adjusted by scarcity).\n\n",
    "Reassignment (unobserved tasks ranked by reward, candidate satellites, window count, and dynamic task key):\n",
    "- Target Ranking: Rank non-owner satellites by window count, total duration, earliest start, and feedback score; filter by feasible candidates.\n",
    "- Migration: Trial top target satellites for highest internal-score gain.\n",
    "- Replacement: If migration fails, replace overlapping/nearby lower-reward observations for top-K tasks (or multi-task removal).\n",
    "- Exchange: Assign task while relocating conflicting task to another satellite.\n",
    "- Bundling: Assign clusters of tasks with nearby window starts to a shared satellite.\n",
    "- Acceptance: Accept moves with largest positive internal-score gain; may trigger full-satellite recalibration."
  ],
